{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:calmBreathingVerdictTied", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "calmBreathingVerdictTied", "text": "Two of the paces scored the same, so this sitting cannot separate them. Nothing has changed.", "sha256": "3f7327c72efa21a23c106b8959a43e4e422e83aa7d0f3f43f23ed0ded539a7ae", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:calmBreathingVerdictConfirmed", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "calmBreathingVerdictConfirmed", "text": "Of the paces tested, {w} gave your strongest response — and that is now two sittings in a row. Resonance is paced there.", "sha256": "970cb9fb5e102517359bcbe980c7e527b4db5fabc8a095981097ea08d17ca3e9", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:calmBreathingVerdictFirstWin", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "calmBreathingVerdictFirstWin", "text": "Of the paces tested, {w} gave your strongest response. Nothing is set yet: the pace only changes when two sittings pick the same one.", "sha256": "73d3f26d4323c97997ce99bf245669a3f686933405ae97682443204a02bc0b8f", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:breathPatternBoxName", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "breathPatternBoxName", "text": "Box", "sha256": "512fd3c6042cd1d9150d46fa59b5911a1f97b8275d73eb0a841daa31e93bd349", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:breathPatternBoxDesc", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "breathPatternBoxDesc", "text": "Four counts each way, holds included. Steadying when your head is racing.", "sha256": "193df214c2280a4e0373f088b44de22c5d0a2da08271eced31f784f8f28ab927", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:breathPattern478Name", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "breathPattern478Name", "text": "4-7-8", "sha256": "b7828a394d01e8b7596df9f2cca26428e28a14fb0a675c39834ff118c2eb0abb", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:breathPattern478Desc", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "breathPattern478Desc", "text": "A long hold and a longer exhale. Usually used to get to sleep.", "sha256": "d3b6b656906746bfdbad0fd0efcd83eb7269393805c26c4b0c6fe51cbc6cbff3", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:breathPatternExtendedExhaleName", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "breathPatternExtendedExhaleName", "text": "Long exhale", "sha256": "3ab558748b3522079566ec2ab17431f59befdcff26215ae144167dd692ba52f5", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:breathPatternExtendedExhaleDesc", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "breathPatternExtendedExhaleDesc", "text": "Out for twice as long as in. No holds, so it is easy to keep up for a while.", "sha256": "0cd3858c00b10009abf195dfddbfaf404ee17dded2eb8f2ae9bd91a4105c8928", "kind": "arb"}
